/Title (As the founder, I managed every aspect of the platform independently. I researched and wrote articles, published content on Medium, managed the Instagram account, created visual content, planned content calendars, and developed the platform's overall identity and communication strategy. Throughout the project, I published more than ten long-form articles covering topics related to student life, wellbeing, academic pressure, personal development, and learning.)
