794 0 obj
<<
/Title (Thy Academia was an educational and student-focused platform I founded to explore the realities of academic life beyond grades and productivity. The platform focused on student wellbeing, personal growth, learning, motivation, and the challenges many students face throughout their educational journeys. Through thoughtful content, I aimed to create a space where students felt understood, supported, and encouraged to approach education in a healthier and more sustainable way.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 772 0 R
/Prev 790 0 R
/Next 791 0 R
>>
